;
; How Cove files one tunnel, in MYRA (cove_rules.h CR4): its number
; (0 .. 99), the far device's row on the signed roster (0 .. 7, devmesh
; holds 8), the Endian Hopping band (0 control .. 4 bulk, ehop.bands), the
; channel id and the key epoch (0 .. 2^32 - 1 each), the last seq sent
; (eighteen digits, the channel's nonce space) and when it last moved (ms
; since 1970). No piece holds a key: the channel secret is the caller's,
; given for one call and never filed.
^ZXCOVE(tunnel:i2) = peer:i1! ^ band:i1! ^ chan:i10! ^ epoch:i10! ^ seq:i18! ^ stamp:i15!
